homepage: https://github.com/All-Hands-AI/agent-sdk
notes: |
  This is the OpenHands Agent SDK (Python library) + its first-party tools
  package. Distinct from the original OpenHands app (`openhands-ai`).

  Runtime model in agent-bench: the SDK runs inside the harness container
  (built from agent_bench/harnesses/openhands/docker/Dockerfile). Tool calls are
  re-routed through the shared exec-bridge so they land in the SWE-bench
  sandbox container — same protocol OpenClaw uses. The agent's own RUNTIME
  is set to "process" so the SDK never tries to spawn its own DockerRuntime.
